<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p>Some links on this site may be affiliate links, for example to a vehicle history report or an auto parts seller. If you buy through one of those links, this site may earn a commission, at no extra cost to you.</p>
<p>Affiliate relationships never change the complaint and recall data, which comes straight from NHTSA public APIs. How those counts are made is on the <a href="/about/">method and sources</a> page.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
